{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00062",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.69,
      "end_seconds": 5.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "Hello. Right, let's get started. Did you come far?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 6.61,
      "end_seconds": 11.17,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "Not too far, about half an hour by bus."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 12.0,
      "end_seconds": 14.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "So, how have things been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 15.11,
      "end_seconds": 19.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.81,
      "text": "It's a dry cough that won't go away, mostly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.57,
      "end_seconds": 22.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "When did you first notice it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.64,
      "end_seconds": 38.23,
      "duration_seconds": 10.59,
      "text": "Well, hm. It was either the end of last month or earlier than that. I couldn't tell you the date."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.24,
      "end_seconds": 44.6,
      "duration_seconds": 5.36,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.09,
      "end_seconds": 54.19,
      "duration_seconds": 6.1,
      "text": "I get some relief from sipping water. It happens all the time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.0,
      "end_seconds": 58.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "Anything that tends to go along with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 60.59,
      "end_seconds": 66.73,
      "duration_seconds": 6.14,
      "text": "It, It usually comes with a sour taste in the mouth."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.84,
      "end_seconds": 71.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "Have you been clearing your throat all the time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.96,
      "end_seconds": 88.21,
      "duration_seconds": 15.25,
      "text": "I mean, yes, for six months. Oh, um, and a hoarse voice in the mornings. Um, the sour taste in the mouth? That's been for about a year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 89.9,
      "end_seconds": 99.01,
      "duration_seconds": 9.11,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Pulse 84, oxygen saturation is 99 percent, respiratory rate 15. BP is 112 over 74, temperature 36.7."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.64,
      "end_seconds": 102.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.53,
      "text": "Good, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.76,
      "end_seconds": 107.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "Can I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.39,
      "end_seconds": 110.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Take your time, no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.35,
      "end_seconds": 131.74,
      "duration_seconds": 5.39,
      "text": "Chest is clear and the throat looks a little red at the back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.32,
      "end_seconds": 133.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.1,
      "text": "Yes, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.14,
      "end_seconds": 145.78,
      "duration_seconds": 8.64,
      "text": "Thanks, please take a seat again. Let me check a few things. Any coughing up blood, wheezing or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.41,
      "end_seconds": 149.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.39,
      "end_seconds": 156.68,
      "duration_seconds": 7.29,
      "text": "Go on. Let me check a few things. Any shortness of breath, night sweats or trouble swallowing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.26,
      "end_seconds": 158.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.74,
      "end_seconds": 162.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Neurologically, anything strange?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.98,
      "end_seconds": 166.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "No weakness or anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.23,
      "end_seconds": 170.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "Okay, any muscle or joint problems besides this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.95,
      "end_seconds": 174.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "So, I move fine otherwise."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.27,
      "end_seconds": 179.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "What medicines are you taking at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 185.05,
      "end_seconds": 196.41,
      "duration_seconds": 11.36,
      "text": "It's Seretide inhaler, twice a day. Um, I take amlodipine, 5 milligrams, once a day for my pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 198.27,
      "end_seconds": 202.94,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "Doctor, our chart from the last visit lists it as 10 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.75,
      "end_seconds": 208.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Alright. Did you bring the up-to-date prescription?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 209.41,
      "end_seconds": 218.11,
      "duration_seconds": 8.7,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time. I mean, I take Digene, after meals."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.56,
      "end_seconds": 222.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Roughly how long on that one?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 223.49,
      "end_seconds": 225.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "For about a month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.93,
      "end_seconds": 234.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "And your work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 235.51,
      "end_seconds": 239.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "I drive a delivery van all day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.31,
      "end_seconds": 242.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "Do you live alone?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 243.24,
      "end_seconds": 246.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "Yes, I live on my own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.2,
      "end_seconds": 263.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Is there anything medical in your background?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 267.35,
      "end_seconds": 273.76,
      "duration_seconds": 6.41,
      "text": "I've got asthma. I have high blood pressure, for five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.55,
      "end_seconds": 279.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "Understood. Alright, high blood pressure, that matches what I have here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.25,
      "end_seconds": 325.09,
      "duration_seconds": 34.84,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. This is probably a cough driven by acid reflux. We shouldn't forget cough-variant asthma. A chest X-ray is what I'd like next, for chronic cough. Breathing tests is what I'd like next, for chronic cough. We'll begin with pantoprazole, 40 milligrams, before breakfast, for four weeks. You take it by mouth. That should help with reflux. The pharmacy will go through the details again when you pick it up."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 326.94,
      "end_seconds": 332.36,
      "duration_seconds": 5.42,
      "text": "Hmm, should I keep taking it if I feel better?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 334.17,
      "end_seconds": 352.24,
      "duration_seconds": 18.07,
      "text": "Don't eat for two or three hours before lying down, and raise the head of the bed a little. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 354.34,
      "end_seconds": 357.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "Yes, I'll keep that in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 358.76,
      "end_seconds": 365.21,
      "duration_seconds": 6.45,
      "text": "Please come and see me in a month. That's it on my side. Anything unclear?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 366.29,
      "end_seconds": 370.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "Uh, alright, thanks. Bye for now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 371.48,
      "end_seconds": 372.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.42,
      "text": "See you then."
    }
  ]
}